on_service_openspec_specs_jira_mapping_catalog_spec_req_distinguish_review_projection_from_disposable_data", "label": "Requirement: distinguish the review projection from disposable data", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/specs/jira-mapping-catalog/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Documentation (docs/README.md and the pilot-local evidence README) must explain mapping_catalog_review so it is not deleted by mistake; it is safe to regenerate from versioned files."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_specs_jira_mapping_catalog_spec_operative_mappings_collection", "label": "Operative mappings collection in MongoDB", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/specs/jira-mapping-catalog/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Runtime source of mappings used to translate tickets; separate from mapping_catalog_review."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_specs_jira_mapping_catalog_spec_mapping_catalog_review_collection", "label": "mapping_catalog_review collection (review projection)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/specs/jira-mapping-catalog/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Review-only projection regenerated from versioned files; Git stays source of truth and the runtime service does not read it."}, {"id": "bkt_integration_service_openspec_specs_jira_mapping_catalog_spec_review_not_operational_sentinel_meshid", "label": "Sentinel meshId REVIEW-NOT-OPERATIONAL", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "bkt-integration-service/openspec/specs/jira-mapping-catalog/spec.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale